fileCloser is capability
fileCloser grants close file
fileCloser purpose "Authority to close todos.json"

heapAllocator is capability
heapAllocator grants allocate heap
heapAllocator purpose "Authority to allocate the todo arrays and buffers"

heapReleaser is capability
heapReleaser grants free heap
heapReleaser purpose "Authority to free the todo arrays and buffers"

