readTuiKey branch if isDeleteSoftKey goto returnIgnoredSoftKey
readTuiKey return keyCode
readTuiKey at returnArrowUpKey return tuiKeyArrowUp
readTuiKey at returnArrowDownKey return tuiKeyArrowDown
readTuiKey at returnArrowLeftKey return tuiKeyArrowLeft
readTuiKey at returnArrowRightKey return tuiKeyArrowRight
