main purpose "Run a heap-array backed keyboard todo TUI with JSON persistence"
main invariant "Two parallel heap arrays (doneArray stride 1, titlesArray stride titleCapacity) keyed by the same index hold each todo"
main invariant "Every interactive mutation exits through persistTodosThenLoop so todos.json reflects the new state before the next render"
